        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CLB150SS6, 1-1/2\" Diameter Wood Door Pull with Stainless Steel Sigma Brackets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Columbia Door Pull is available with either satin stainless steel or polished stainless steel mounting brackets. Choose from one of 4 different  <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\" target=\"new\">wood types</a>: cherry, mahogany, white oak, and black walnut. This 1-1/2 inch Diameter Wood Door Pull with Stainless Steel Sigma Brackets is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths with surface mounting, back-to-back mounting, or thru-bolt mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n<br>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/columbia-wood-door-pull-first-impressions-clb150sbr\">Columbia Door Pull</a> with more bracket finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions CLB150SS6 Wood Door Handle with Stainless Steel Brackets:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel 316</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CLB02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262328\"><b>First Impressions CLB150SS6 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CLB150018SS6:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CLB150024SS6:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CLB150036SS6:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
